🔑 Most Important Commands (Exam Focus)
Command	Purpose
oc api-resources	list resource types
oc explain	view schema
oc get	retrieve resources
oc describe	detailed human info
oc get -o yaml/json	structured output
oc get -o jsonpath	extract fields
oc get -o custom-columns	custom output

